OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785327525
OL,3,CBikes seized from park after multiple
OL,4,Creports of anti-social behaviour
OL,6,FA number of bikes have been seized by
OL,7,Fpolice in Kent after multiple reports
OL,8,Fof anti-social behaviour in a Ramsgate
OL,9,Fpark.
OL,11,FOfficers received reports from
OL,12,FEllington Park, including bicycles
OL,13,Fbeing ridden in an unsafe and
OL,14,Fthreatening manner, between May and
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FGroups of teenagers who had gathered
OL,18,Fin the park were reported to have been
OL,19,Fverbally abusive towards staff and
OL,20,Fmembers of the public.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
