PN,38902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785327525
OL,3,CBikes seized from park after multiple
OL,4,Creports of anti-social behaviour
OL,6,FThey reportedly climbed onto a
OL,7,Fbandstand roof, and were cycling at
OL,8,Fhigh speed past pedestrians.
OL,10,FPolice say damage was further reported
OL,11,Fto park facilities at an on-site cafe.
OL,13,FDuring an operation on Thursday 23
OL,14,FJuly, a dispersal order legislation
OL,15,Fwas used to order eight suspected
OL,16,Ftroublemakers to leave the area, and
OL,17,Feight bicycles were also seized.
OL,26,@sD@err
