OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785327525
OL,3,CBikes seized from park after multiple
OL,4,Creports of anti-social behaviour
OL,6,FThanet Community Safety Unit Inspector
OL,7,FRich Batten said: "We are fortunate to
OL,8,Fhave some lovely parks in Thanet,
OL,9,Fwhich are appreciated by residents and
OL,10,Fvisitors alike and which staff and
OL,11,Fcommunity groups work hard to keep
OL,12,Fsafe and enjoyable for everyone.
OL,14,F"We absolutely will not tolerate the
OL,15,Factions of those whose appalling
OL,16,Fbehaviour would spoil these beautiful
OL,17,Fspaces for the vast majority of
OL,18,Fpeople, who behave courteously and
OL,19,Frespectfully towards others.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1785327525
OL,3,CBikes seized from park after multiple
OL,4,Creports of anti-social behaviour
OL,6,F"Under dispersal order legislation, as
OL,7,Fwell as ordering anyone suspected of
OL,8,Fantisocial behaviour to leave the
OL,9,Farea, officers are able to seize items
OL,10,Fsuspected of being used in an
OL,11,Fantisocial manner, including bicycles.
OL,13,F"Anyone riding a bike responsibly is
OL,14,Fwelcome to do so.
OL,16,F"We will continue our enforcement
OL,17,Factivity and I would urge anyone
OL,18,Fexperiencing issues to report
OL,19,Fincidents to us promptly, to ensure we
OL,20,Fcan deliver a robust and proportionate
OL,21,Fresponse."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
